2026-07-27T12:22:16.4745615Z i /tmp/RtmpBmwC9J/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:22:16.4746053Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:22:16.4746573Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:22:16.4747010Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:22:16.4747694Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:22:16.4748716Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:22:16.4749836Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
